The film is loosely based on the Dora the Explorer franchise, and stars Samantha Lorraine, Jacob Rodriguez, Mariana
Garzón Toro, Acston Luca Porto, Christian Gnecco Quintero, Gabriel Iglesias, and Daniella Pineda.

12
